        expected: the hover of Starter lists seats 1 from Plan; the CSV has Starter with 10 and 1 and Team with 40 and 5, and no row for Basic, which is the default and not an Example
    - B11 Equals Defines And A Doubled Equals Is Literal
        area: syntax
        fixture: Quote below
        try: hover the name Q1, and look at the colours on the vat line of Quote and on the note line of Q1
        expected: the hover lists the note as a = b means equal; the Python after the single equals sign of vat is coloured as code, and the doubled equals of the note as an escape
    - B12 The CSV Mirror Writes Back
        area: csv
        fixture: Stock below, and aot.files/Stock.csv after a save
        try: save this file; in the CSV change Bolt to 6 and save it; then empty the count of Washer in the CSV and save it
        expected: after each CSV save this file changes and saves itself; Bolt reads 6, and the count cell of Washer is empty
    - B13 A Dropped Row Is Asked About
        area: csv
        fixture: aot.files/Stock.csv
        try: delete the Screw row from the CSV and save it, then choose Keep
        expected: the CSV has Screw back at once, and a notice asks whether to delete it from release 1.13.aot too; Keep leaves Screw here
    - B14 A Cell Both Sides Changed
        area: csv
        fixture: Stock below, aot.files/Stock.csv, and the setting aot.tableCsvSyncMode
